SUMMARY:Registration Open for Winter 2027 Programs
DESCRIPTION:Registration is now open for Davis Forest School’s Winter 2027 Programs. This Winter\, from January – March\, we are offering: \n– 4 Afterschool classes in Davis\n– 5 Homeschool classes across Sacramento\, Placer County\, & Davis\n– 6 Parent/Child classes across Sacramento\, Placer County\, & Davis \nOur programs are 100% outdoors\, rain or shine. Join us for a magical winter of nature connection as we spot mushrooms\, play in mud\, and witness the early blossoms bloom on the trees together. \nVisit our website for more informatioan about each program and to register!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/registration-open-for-winter-2027-programs/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Outside
