SUMMARY:Brawn\, Brews & Brats: A Day of Work\, Brotherhood\, and Courage
DESCRIPTION:YoloCares Hosts Regional Gathering for Men and Boys Focused on Healing\, Mentorship\, and Community Service \n  \nDavis\, CA — In partnership with the Sutter Health Foundation\, YoloCares’ Center for Loss & Hope will host Brawn\, Brews & Brats: A Day of Work\, Brotherhood\, and Courage on October 24\, 2026\, bringing together men\, teens\, and boys from across the region for a unique community-based mental health initiative centered on grief\, mentorship\, and service. \nParticipants from the organization’s GriefWise men’s gatherings\, youth GriefBall camps\, and Grief Ranch programs will spend the afternoon completing public service projects before gathering for a shared meal and closing reflection ritual. \nThe event reflects a growing recognition that unprocessed grief often appears as anger\, isolation\, or violence among men and boys. By combining physical work\, intergenerational mentorship\, and structured reflection\, YoloCares aims to offer a healthier pathway. \n“Many young men are taught to carry pain alone\,” says Dr. Chris Erdman\, Director of the Center for Loss & Hope. “This day shows another possibility — that strength can mean building something together\, speaking honestly about the pain we carry\, and committing ourselves to be a creative force for good in our communities and families.” \nThe event aligns with statewide efforts to address the mental health needs of men and boys through connection\, mentorship\, and community engagement. \nBrawn\, Brews & Brats is not a clinical program but a public demonstration of an emerging model: transforming grief into belonging and responsibility through shared labor and ritual. \nFor more information: Dr. Chris Erdman\, Director\, The Center for Loss & Hope atYoloCares\, cerdman@yolocares.org or generally at griefsupport@yolocares.org. \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/brawn-brews-brats-a-day-of-work-brotherhood-and-courage/
LOCATION:Galileo Place\, 1909 Galileo Place\, Suite C\, Davis\, CA\, 95618\, United States
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR